   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## LM Studio Prompt Enhancer + MOSS-Image\n\nLoad a picture: the enhancer describes it as a MOSS prompt and applies the changes you type in its words box (optional).\n\n- Start LM Studio's server and load your model (e.g. Gemma 4 31B). Click the status line on the node to test.\n- clip is wired into the enhancer only to count the prompt in MOSS's own tokens (warns past 512).\n- Seed fixed: the same prompt every queue. Hold freezes the prompt while you tweak the sampler.\n- Sampler settings follow ComfyUI's MOSS-Image template. Model files: huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
